  "voice_id": "UsAXJEjvlWhVP6jyvPWx",
  "nom": "Le chroniqueur",
  "description": "A plain, natural narrator: clear mid-range voice, neither deep nor gravelly, relaxed and even — someone reading a story aloud at an ordinary pace without performing it. No solemnity, no hush, no dramatic colour, no theatrical pauses. Neutral, unforced, easy to listen to for a long time. Must not sound like a character in a scene. Speaks French.",
